  "summary": {
    "zh": "该产品为密封条型材，主要材质为PVC，适用于IC管配件等应用场景，支持规格定制与批量供货。",
    "en": "This sealing strip profile is primarily made from PVC and is suitable for IC Tube Accessories applications. Custom dimensions and bulk supply are supported."
  },
  "description": {
    "zh": [
      "密封条型材面向工业与消费品配套场景，可用于防护、包覆、导向和连接等需求。",
      "主要材质为PVC，可按项目要求匹配尺寸、壁厚、长度和结构形式，适配不同应用工况。",
      "包装与交付可按需求配置（如单件重量(g) 20），支持稳定供货与长期项目协同。"
    ],
    "en": [
      "This sealing strip profile is designed for industrial and consumer assembly programs requiring protection, covering, guidance, and connection functions.",
      "The primary material is PVC, and dimensions such as outer diameter, wall thickness, length, and profile form can be aligned to project requirements.",
      "Packaging and delivery can be configured as needed (for example: Unit Weight (g) 20), supporting stable supply and long-term project coordination."
    ]
  },
